␀␀␀blk >= 0 && blk < EFUSE_BLK_MAX␀//IDF/components/efuse/src/esp_efuse_utility.c␀␀num_reg <= (range_read_addr_blocks[blk].end - range_read_addr_blocks[blk].start) / sizeof(uint32_t)␀efuse␀␀␀E (%lu) %s: Range of data does not match the coding scheme
␀bits_counter <= req_size␀␀␀␀esp_security␀␀␀␀E (%lu) %s: Flash encryption with CPU frequency > 160MHz is not supported. Please reconfigure the CPU frequency.
␀␀␀spi_flash␀␀␀W (%lu) %s: CPU frequency is set to 240MHz. esp_flash_write_encrypted() will automatically limit CPU frequency to %dMHz during execution.
